# (build 161) The rumble through the spaceship's flight, roof_yes's way to
# Skure: still on the roof; the ship's departure followed as the driver
# starts its sound (the ship fading in) and the throb while it flies; the
# pause in SpaceShipLoop stilling it (the Pause sound cuts the departure's,
# the throb waits), Start again bringing the throb back; the landing felt
# once as the level's screen is asked for, both motors full, then the
# landing's sound followed till the level's music cuts it; still on Skure
# (src/game/rumble.c).
start building 8 21 0 0 32 16   # the tower desk; the street is 32,16
flag $C73F 1                    # Gaira's $2F: ROOF on the desk
rumble-log motors.txt 3         # the motors at HIGH, change by change
wait idle
press down
press down
press c                         # ROOF: building 11, portrait $18
wait screen building
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c                         # YES: $F02, DezolisSkure $4F0,$3C0
wait idle
expect rumble still
press c                         # loc_C572: 21 ticks of PaletteFadeFrom
wait ticks 25                   # the ship fading in, its sound begun
expect rumble going
expect rumble landed 0
wait ticks 40                   # SpaceShipLoop
expect rumble going
press start                     # the pause
wait ticks 45
expect rumble still             # the throb waits, the sound cut
press start                     # on again
wait ticks 3
expect rumble going
wait ticks 95                   # SpaceShipLoop's 120 ticks over at 580
expect rumble landed 1
expect rumble going             # both full, the landing's sound after
wait screen level
expect rumble still             # the level's music has cut that sound
expect level $03 60 79
